{"id":400301601,"chapter_id":50014,"scene_id":51406,"steps":[{"step":2,"speaker":"雷比尼斯","content":"<color=#fb9259>人类</color>？雷比尼斯的中枢搭载了一个人类的完整神经系统。这样，算是人类吗？","voice":["vo_event_03016_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"……我不知道。","voice":["vo_event_03016_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"雷比尼斯","content":"好奇。你，跟我很像，你也要等待指令吗？","voice":["vo_event_03016_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"我们不一样。","voice":["vo_event_03016_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"如果……我们一样呢？只是她的感情，同样被抑制了的话……","voice":["vo_event_03016_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"赫卡蒂沉默了，她尝试去理解雷比尼斯的感情。","style":3,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"她一定是失去了那个……叫做<color=#fb9259>玛丽</color>的人，那是她重要的人吗？","style":3,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"就像局长对自己一样？","style":3,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"如果失去了局长，现在的自己会和雷比尼斯一样么？","style":3,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"难道……她不是什么过载……只是她很伤心，她不熟悉这种感情，但我明白！","voice":["vo_event_03016_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"她唤起了梦魇，动作不再迟疑，不再犹豫。","style":3,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"雷比尼斯正在重温自己失去的……重要的人的恐惧。","voice":["vo_event_03016_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"赫卡蒂握紧了双手，仿佛局长此刻就在她的身边。","style":3,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"我要用现实……去击破围绕着她的恐惧。","voice":["vo_event_03016_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"用你我最珍视，最不想失去的东西。","voice":["vo_event_03016_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_03_p1b","style":1,"background":2025,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"赫卡蒂默念着一个名字，将手伸向雷比尼斯。","style":3,"background":2025,"log_type":1}]}